Swimming Pool Design — 授權說明 / License

本 repo 依內容種類使用兩種授權，第三方素材除外。
This repository uses two licenses by content type. Third-party material is excluded.

1. 程式 / Code — MIT License
   範圍：core/、tools/、tests/、web/ 內的程式與樣式（.ts、.mjs、.js、.css、.html），
   以及根目錄與 .github/ 的設定檔。
   Scope: source code and styles under core/, tools/, tests/ and web/, plus the
   configuration files at the root and under .github/.

2. 文件、設計、圖面與照片 / Documents, design, drawings and photos — CC BY 4.0
   範圍：docs/、content/、drawings/、model/、source-materials/ 與 web/ 內的影像，
   第 3 點列出的除外。
   Scope: docs/, content/, drawings/, model/, source-materials/ and the images under
   web/, except the items listed in section 3.
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

3. 不在上述授權範圍內的第三方素材 / Third-party material not covered above
   - source-materials/site/SRC-SITE-001_google-maps-satellite.png 及以它為底的
     標註圖 SRC-SITE-002、SRC-SITE-004，與網站圖面頁使用的衍生檔
     web/src/views/drawings/assets/site-satellite.jpg：
     地圖資料與影像權利屬 Google 及其資料提供者，僅作為概念設計的來源證據保存。
     The Google Maps satellite image and the annotated images based on it
     (SRC-SITE-001, SRC-SITE-002, SRC-SITE-004), and its derivative
     web/src/views/drawings/assets/site-satellite.jpg shown on the drawings page.
     Map data and imagery belong to Google and its data providers.
   - source-materials/site/SRC-SITE-005_school-emblem-transparent.png 及其衍生的
     web/src/shared/assets/brand/school-emblem-header.png：校徽屬學校所有。
     The school emblem and its derived header image belong to the school.
   - source-materials/site/SRC-SITE-003_pvgis-5-3-tmy.json：氣象資料來自
     European Commission Joint Research Centre PVGIS 5.3，依其使用條款引用並標註出處。
     Weather data from the European Commission Joint Research Centre PVGIS 5.3,
     used under its own terms with attribution.
   - node_modules/ 與 package-lock.json 列出的相依套件依各自的授權。
     Dependencies keep their own licenses.

